<p>Today I&#8217;m featuring the home screen of my pal Dave Myhre. Dave, a former jet pilot and current Christmas Tree farmer, is one of the most thoughtful technology users I know. He&#8217;s the kind of guy who actually thinks about <em>why</em> he sets things up a certain way, not just how. He&#8217;s also been busy planting trees, which tells you something about his priorities. So Dave, show us your home screen.</p>



